n a <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">34</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-ielts-simulation-t8-l-q34\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> within the ranks of the military.</li><li>Frederick should not be held wholly accountable for failing: the <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">35</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-ielts-simulation-t8-l-q35\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> of his fighters made victory difficult to achieve.</li><li>The people Frederick commanded were mostly old men, new conscripts or <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">36</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-ielts-simulation-t8-l-q36\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span>.</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":6},{"id":"en-ielts-simulation-t8-l-g4-1","type":"source_html","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","instructions":"","sourceHeading":"Questions 37-40","sourceHtml":"<div class=\"source-question-section-content\"><div class=\"source-section-content-wrapper\"><p>Complete the notes below.</p><p>Write NO MORE THAN TWO WORDS for each answer.</p><p><b>The Grand Old Duke of York:</b></p><ul><li>wanted to enlist better types of <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">37</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-ielts-simulation-t8-l-q37\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></li><li>made the army better by bringing in chaplains, medics and <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">38</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-ielts-simulation-t8-l-q38\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></li><li>established a college for preparing army <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">39</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-ielts-simulation-t8-l-q39\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></li><li>established school in Chelsea for sons of soldiers</li><li>gave up the position of Commander-in-Chief in 1807 because of a <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">40</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-ielts-simulation-t8-l-q40\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></li><li>re-appointed later (in 1811) by his brother (George IV)</li><li>died in 1827</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":4}],"audio_fallbacks":["https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/ielts-simulation-tests-academic-listening-test-8-4.mp3"],"order_index":4}],"questions":[{"id":"en-ielts-simulation-t8-l-q1","part_id":"en-ielts-simulation-t8-l-p1","group_id":"en-ielts-simulation-t8-l-g1-0","question_type":"source_text","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","question_text":"","correct_answer":"drivers licence/licence/drivers license/license","correct_answer_variants":["drivers licence","licence","drivers license","license"],"answerCount":1,"sourceNumbers":[1],"sourceInputName":"ielts_listening_answer_3219428_1","order_index":1,"points":1},{"id":"en-ielts-simulation-t8-l-q2","part_id":"en-ielts-simulation-t8-l-p1","group_id":"en-ielts-simulation-t8-l-g1-0","question_type":"source_text","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","question_text":"","correct_answer":"AY196310","correct_answer_variants":["AY196310"],"answerCount":1,"sourceNumbers":[2],"sourceInputName":"ielts_listening_answer_3219428_2","order_index":2,"points":1},{"id":"en-ielts-simulation-t8-l-q3","part_id":"en-ielts-simulation-t8-l-p1","group_id":"en